[{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_32600400_01_0000","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_32600400_01_0010","text":"我要夺走……\n你们的血────……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_32600400_01_0001","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_32600400_01_0020","text":"这是下次音乐节目的企划书……\n你能过目一下吗"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_32600400_01_0030","text":"──嘶……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_32600400_01_0040","text":"怎么了，路加……！？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_32600400_01_0050","text":"没什么……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_32600400_01_0060","text":"不可能没什么，都流血了\n等一下，我记得有急救箱──"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_32600400_01_0061","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_32600400_01_0070","text":"在失去……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_32600400_01_0080","text":"（失去的部分，要怎么填补？）"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_32600400_01_0002","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_32600400_01_0090","text":"让我看看伤口\n我给你贴创可贴……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_32600400_01_0100","text":"────……"}]
